{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemessosh"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme Sosh"}],"symbolKind":"module","title":"Theme Sosh","externalID":"OUDSThemesSosh","roleHeading":"Library","images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_sosh.png","type":"icon"}],"role":"collection"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Group","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshBrandColorRawTokens","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshBrandFontRawTokens"],"anchor":"Group"},{"title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/ColorSoshBrandRawToken","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/ColorSoshDecorativeRawToken","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshBrandFontRawToken"],"anchor":"Type-Aliases","generated":true},{"title":"Extended Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/OUDSThemesContract","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SwiftUICore"],"anchor":"Extended-Modules","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Sosh theme is the theme dedicated to the Sosh brand only."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["🧬 Theme version: 2.5.0"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the Sosh theme any Sosh product must use, and cannot be subclassed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It embeds also in its target the Sosh brand colors which are not shared nor exposed in lower level targets or outside any modu